 title=\"Circle of Death\">Circle of Death</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite\" title=\"Eyebite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/20px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/30px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/40px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eyebite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp/20px-Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Eyebite_Panicked_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eyebite\" title=\"Eyebite\">Eyebite</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Harm\" title=\"Harm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Harm_Icon.webp/20px-Harm_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Harm_Icon.webp/30px-Harm_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Harm_Icon.webp/40px-Harm_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Harm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Harm_Icon.webp/20px-Harm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Harm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Harm\" title=\"Harm\">Harm</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><i>Regarding Life Essence Harvest:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Life Essence Harvest has no cooldown and can be triggered without limit.</li>\n<li>Killing a creature with a spell granted from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Life_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Life Essence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Life Essence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Life_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Life Essence (Condition)\">Life Essence</a> does not provide a new charge of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Life_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Life Essence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Life Essence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Life_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Life Essence (Condition)\">Life Essence</a>.</li>\n<li>Indirect spell damage from sources like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spirit_Guardians\" title=\"Spirit Guardians\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp/20px-Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp/30px-Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp/40px-Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spirit Guardians\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp/20px-Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Spirit_Guardians_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spirit_Guardians\" title=\"Spirit Guardians\">Spirit Guardians</a> does not provide a charge of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Life_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Life Essence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Life Essence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Life_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Life Essence (Condition)\">Life Essence</a> when killing a hostile creature.</li>\n<li>Per the <code>GreaterNecromancySpellFilter() .khn</code> script, this effect is intended to allow the casting of an extra Necromancy spell only if the spell level is equal to or lower than the number of Life Essence turns the wielder has. However, this restriction is currently non-functional, and any level of Necromancy spell can be cast using the effect. Though none of the tooltips explicitly mention this functionality, Life Essence displays the number of turns the wielder has on its tooltip.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Life Essence Harvest:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Casting a Necromancy cantrip consumes the Life Essence Harvest charge, even though the character's cast bar does not highlight the cantrip to indicate it will use the effect.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195355\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.136 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.146 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4722/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 108102/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 25175/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.033/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1636828/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  112.787      1 Template:WeaponPage\n100.00%  112.787      1 -total\n 25.46%   28.721     52 Template:Trim\n 18.68%   21.069     13 Template:Icon_text\n 16.05%   18.103      1 Template:Passive_notes_list\n 12.07%   13.618      3 Template:Damage_info\n 11.84%   13.350      7 Template:Icon_link\n 10.64%   12.002      3 Template:Damage_info/primitive\n  9.90%   11.164      6 Template:Damage_colour\n  9.66%   10.891      3 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:10576-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195355 and revision id 371415. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}